    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get Involved!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/cbedc47c4cfab0ba217827e7b79ff4a5.avif?t=1746080036\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Echoes of Elpis</i> is a thrilling twin-stick shooter set within the mighty spaceship Elpis. Battle against relentless enemies, unlock powerful upgrades, and reveal the ship's secret past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.poster.avif?t=1746080036\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.webm?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.mp4?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way through Elpis's rooms to unearth rare technology and artifacts. These epic finds offer power-ups that transform your gameplay, enabling mastery over the ship's defenses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.poster.avif?t=1746080036\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.webm?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.mp4?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Echoes of Elpis </i> melds the unpredictability of roguelite adventures with relentless sci-fi action. Adapt and refine your tactics with every run. The deeper you venture into Elpis, the more its legacy unfolds, beckoning you to etch your name among the stars as the ultimate treasure hunter.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Echoes of Elpis</i> is a thrilling twin-stick shooter set within the mighty spaceship Elpis. Battle against relentless enemies, unlock powerful upgrades, and reveal the ship's secret past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.poster.avif?t=1746080036\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.webm?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/e031e492a13b4c73ab97f4d657fea3d5.mp4?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight your way through Elpis's rooms to unearth rare technology and artifacts. These epic finds offer power-ups that transform your gameplay, enabling mastery over the ship's defenses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.poster.avif?t=1746080036\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.webm?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884720/extras/84efbd9764a772f1653a5d9bb777b4de.mp4?t=1746080036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Echoes of Elpis </i> melds the unpredictability of roguelite adventures with relentless sci-fi action. Adapt and refine your tactics with every run. The deeper you venture into Elpis, the more its legacy unfolds, beckoning you to etch your name among the stars as the ultimate treasure hunter.",
